{"name": "Beaver Creek", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/39acf514776d57989ef8f72b3267ab37.poster.avif?t=1782785179\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/39acf514776d57989ef8f72b3267ab37.webm?t=1782785179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/39acf514776d57989ef8f72b3267ab37.mp4?t=1782785179\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A casual, water-physics puzzle game about building dams as a beaver (2 - 3 hours). Gnaw down trees, and grab and throw objects to organically build dams to back up water and progress to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/3ff3e869e8da484359c1c9c3df3c16a7.poster.avif?t=1782785179\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/3ff3e869e8da484359c1c9c3df3c16a7.webm?t=1782785179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/3ff3e869e8da484359c1c9c3df3c16a7.mp4?t=1782785179\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with dynamic water physics as you build dams piece by piece, creating lush ecosystems for wildlife and unlocking your path forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey at your own pace -- there's no need to rush! No timers, no health bar, no UI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to a lush original soundtrack by Ryan Probert that progresses dynamically as you build each wetland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And encounter cute animals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/1cb265e3b9b9cb9c6f604ca17c6ab759.poster.avif?t=1782785179\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/1cb265e3b9b9cb9c6f604ca17c6ab759.webm?t=1782785179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/1cb265e3b9b9cb9c6f604ca17c6ab759.mp4?t=1782785179\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A casual, water-physics puzzle game about building dams as a beaver (2 - 3 hours). Gnaw down trees, and grab and throw objects to organically build dams, back up water, and progress to the next level.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/8d6cb1e997d43b26bb535f4f6c69aef326719639/header.jpg?t=1782785179", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Relaxing", "Adventure", "Indie", "Cute", "Casual", "Physics"], "developers": "We Shall Be Monsters", "publishers": "We Shall Be Monsters", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3759000", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/j1iNDAGW0pI", "first_seen": 1787672338.555697}